<item><title>Mashaba returns as Johannesburg mayor, beating the DA&apos;s Helen Zille</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/mashaba-returns-as-johannesburg-mayor-beating-the-da-s-556f66/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/mashaba-returns-as-johannesburg-mayor-beating-the-da-s-556f66/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>The ActionSA leader was elected at a council sitting, after coalition talks involving the ANC, ActionSA and the Economic Freedom Fighters (EFF) party.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Johannesburg raises residential water tariffs from Tuesday 1 December</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/johannesburg-raises-residential-water-tariffs-from-tuesday-bf71cc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/johannesburg-raises-residential-water-tariffs-from-tuesday-bf71cc/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>The new Level 2 rates lift the monthly water charge for a household using 10 kilolitres from R134.28 to R196.72, excluding other charges.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:40:49 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/johannesburg-raises-residential-water-tariffs-from-tuesday-bf71cc/share.jpg" length="45659" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/johannesburg-raises-residential-water-tariffs-from-tuesday-bf71cc/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
